<!--
  The static routes only.

  /notes/:slug is enumerated from a GitHub repository at page load, so it
  cannot be listed here without going stale the moment a note is added. And
  /blog/:slug is not served by the router in production - the Cloudflare Worker
  owns that path and proxies it to Blogger - so a local post slug here would
  point at a URL that resolves to something else.

  No <lastmod>: a date nobody remembers to update is worse than no date, and
  Google ignores <priority> and <changefreq> outright.

  Add a route to App.jsx, add it here.
-->
